%% Answer submission and next action
flowchart TB
  Request[Authenticated Answer Request] --> Ownership[Load Owned Session and Turn]
  Ownership --> Claim[Claim Turn and Check Request Hash]
  Claim --> Existing{Existing Result?}
  Existing -->|Yes| Replay[Replay Stored Response]
  Existing -->|No| Evaluate[Evaluate Answer]
  Evaluate --> Persist[Persist Evaluation]
  Persist --> Decide[Apply Follow-up and Difficulty Rules]
  Decide --> Complete{Session Complete?}
  Complete -->|No| Next[Create Next Question]
  Complete -->|Yes| Finish[Mark Session Completed]
  Next --> Response[Return Updated Session]
  Finish --> Response
